        >
          <li>
            Solutions Engineer (integration-heavy products)
          </li>
          <li>
            Thrives in transitional technical environments
          </li>
          <li>
            Logistics / supply chain software
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        class="role-family-tags"
      >
        <span
          class="role-family-tags-label"
        >
